  "description": {
    "text": "The 2009 contest was held by twelve Shogakukan children's magazines, joined after its announcement by Weekly Shōnen Sunday, for the 12th film, Arceus and the Jewel of Life. Readers colored in a blank outline of Arceus or Spiky-eared Pichu drawn by manga artists, and each magazine's grand prize winner was promised 100 copies of their design as a card and a Giratina edition Nintendo DS Lite: 13 designs, seven on Arceus and six on Pichu. Few copies have surfaced, and how many each winner received is unclear.",
